00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,666
When the two rates are equal, the solution is saturated, and we have a dynamic equilibrium.

2
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:12,109
The concentration of a pure solid is constant, so it is folded into the constant.

3
00:00:12,109 --> 00:00:19,010
What remains is the solubility product, K s p, equal to silver ion times chloride ion.

